; mapaim.eval - where mapview.eval's pointer goes (code-review C373 / C374).
; Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 41, on its scratch world.
;
; The editor opened on the harness level at zoom 1: `editor view` gives the
; map's rectangle in window pixels and `editor button level` the Level button's
; centre. The judge aims mapview.eval's wheel near the map's far corner (where
; the old zoom drifted most) and its click on that button, both from here, so
; neither depends on the window's size.

logecho on
reset
timescale 0
editor
echo --- aim ---
editor view
editor button level
echo --- end ---
